
extends base

block content

	main
	
		section.rentalGuidePage
			.container
		
				.rentalGuidePage--box
					.rentalGuidePage--heading-box

						h1.rentalGuidePage--heading Rental Guidelines
						p.rentalGuidePage__tagline Important information for your rental enquiry
						p.rentalGuidePage__text Please review the guidelines below before making a booking. These terms help us keep each outfit in excellent condition and ready for every special occasion.

						ul.rentalGuidePage__guidelines
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Rental period:
								|  3 days
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Booking fee:
								|  Depending on the item/s to be rented, a non-refundable booking fee is required to secure your rental.
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Security deposit:
								|  A $50 refundable security deposit is required and will be returned once the outfit is received in its original condition
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Late returns:
								|  Late returns will incur an additional fee of $10 per day
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Care of outfit:
								|  Please do not wash, dry clean, or alter the outfit
							li.rentalGuidePage__guideline
								strong Damages or loss:
								|  Any damage, missing items, or loss will be charged accordingly

						p.rentalGuidePage__note For any questions about sizing, availability, or booking, please submit your rental enquiry form 